1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,351
Welcome to UNITY CARRIER.

2
00:00:02,401 --> 00:00:04,892
Let's get you calling in under three minutes.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,937
It takes three simple steps.

4
00:00:08,987 --> 00:00:14,998
Create your account, top up with crypto, then call from a SIP app or straight from your browser.

5
00:00:15,997 --> 00:00:17,784
First, create your account.

6
00:00:17,834 --> 00:00:22,438
Open www.unitycarrier.com/panel and tap "Create an account".

7
00:00:22,488 --> 00:00:26,046
Choose a username and a password, and fill in your details.

8
00:00:26,096 --> 00:00:28,480
Then accept the terms and tap Signup.

9
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:32,791
Prefer some help? Message us on Telegram and we'll set it up for you.

10
00:00:36,997 --> 00:00:39,766
Now log in with your username and password.

11
00:00:39,816 --> 00:00:45,165
Your desktop has everything you need: Top up, SIP Users and your call history.

12
00:00:47,997 --> 00:00:52,344
To add credit, open Top up, pick an amount and tap "Pay with crypto".

13
00:00:52,394 --> 00:00:56,187
On the checkout, choose a coin and send the exact amount shown.

14
00:00:56,237 --> 00:01:00,434
As soon as the payment confirms, your balance updates automatically.

15
00:01:09,997 --> 00:01:12,275
You can also top up without logging in.

16
00:01:12,325 --> 00:01:20,256
On pay.unitycarrier.com/pay, type your username, choose an amount and continue to the secure checkout.

17
00:01:23,997 --> 00:01:25,507
Or use Telegram.

18
00:01:25,557 --> 00:01:30,438
Open our bot, send /topup, type your username, tap an amount, then Pay.

19
00:01:30,488 --> 00:01:33,405
The bot tells you the moment your credit arrives.

20
00:01:38,997 --> 00:01:41,894
To make calls, you need your SIP login.

21
00:01:41,944 --> 00:01:46,846
Open SIP Users. Your SIP username and password are right here.

22
00:01:46,896 --> 00:01:54,101
Our server is www.unitycarrier.com, port 5060, UDP.

23
00:01:55,101 --> 00:01:59,875
Install any SIP app, such as Zoiper, Linphone or MicroSIP.

24
00:01:59,925 --> 00:02:04,955
Add a SIP account with your SIP username, your password and our server.

25
00:02:05,005 --> 00:02:09,394
When it shows Registered, dial the country code and the number, and you're through.

26
00:02:16,101 --> 00:02:18,443
No app? Call right from your browser.

27
00:02:18,493 --> 00:02:22,051
In SIP Users, select your line and tap Webphone.

28
00:02:22,101 --> 00:02:25,381
Allow the microphone, dial the number and tap Call.

29
00:02:34,101 --> 00:02:36,763
Finally, open Telegram & security.

30
00:02:36,813 --> 00:02:43,934
Connect Telegram for payment messages and low-balance alerts, and turn on two-step login to protect your account.

31
00:02:43,984 --> 00:02:48,053
Share your invite link, and you and your friend both get bonus credit.

32
00:02:49,053 --> 00:02:50,776
That's it. Happy calling!

33
00:02:50,826 --> 00:02:53,901
Questions? Just message us on Telegram.

